## 8. EV FINANCE PAGE

Use the approved EV Finance reference image.

### Hero section
Heading: “Drive Cleaner, Save Smarter”

Supporting text:

“Explore electric vehicles, compare estimated running costs, and understand your financing options.”

### Petrol versus EV bar graph

Display a bar graph comparing:
- Current estimated annual petrol or petrol/diesel vehicle running costs.
- Estimated annual EV running costs.

Include currency in INR, chart labels, reporting period, and a clear comparison.

Calculate:

Estimated annual savings = Current annual vehicle running costs − Estimated annual EV running costs.

Percentage reduction = Estimated annual savings / Current annual vehicle running costs × 100.

Only calculate the percentage when the denominator is positive.

Use consistent reporting periods and clearly disclose the assumptions used for fuel price, driving distance, fuel efficiency, EV energy consumption, and charging cost.

